('G2','Reproducibility quantities','Stock final volume/molarity, Ar/vacuum pressure, injection speed, stirring rpm, cooling trace, numerical overnight duration, primary redispersion amount and synthetic yield are absent. Source loading labels are retained without reconstructed molarity.'),
